Then
\begin{enumerate}
\item for any closed point $x \in X$ the extension $\kappa(x)/k$
is algebraic, and
\item $X$ is a Jacobson scheme
(Properties, Definition \ref{properties-definition-jacobson}).
\end{enumerate}

